{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045230/extras/83fddcdb21019a82c600aa3d446ccc90.webp?t=1758878034\" width=617 height=57 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vichitra, literally meaning bizarre or weird is the best word to describe the world in which the game takes place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Aditya, who belongs to a remote village in the Himalayas where his family has roots in the ancient Indian culture and mythology. In this Demo, Aditya is nearing a village where he is attacked by something sinister. He investigates and stumbles upon a villager. Can he help this village in time? This is the main quest in this Demo.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200bSingle player narrative with an influence on Game Choices and its Impact on the World.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linear Game structure with semi-open worlds for exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic graphics with a fresh take and flavor on Over The Top action sequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in North India. The Player's journey from Delhi to his remote village in the Himalayas in his old car makes him stumble upon a remote village on the way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face an epic battle using many Physical and Supernatural weapons (both ranged and close combat) besides melee combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supernatural detective elements and case-solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use many forms of magic and face curses and boons as you progress through the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make choices and gain vardaan and Dosh from the Gods and divine entities.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4045230?t=1758878034","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset