old car makes him stumble upon a remote village on the way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face an epic battle using many Physical and Supernatural weapons (both ranged and close combat) besides melee combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supernatural detective elements and case-solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use many forms of magic and face curses and boons as you progress through the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make choices and gain vardaan and Dosh from the Gods and divine entities.\u00a0</p>","developers":["The Chakra Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"4029130","name":"Vichitra - Chakra"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045230/35ab94117e75d4c0fc1acd977b5f9347d988df59/header.jpg?t=1758878034","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"Vichitra - Chakra and all its properties belong to The Chakra Games.<br />\r\nAll Rights Reserved.<br />\r\n\u00a9Chakra Games Private Limited<br />\r\n2025<br />\r\nThe Chakra Games(TM)","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4045230/916498054/50c7dce599dbd86b632c3b90853eaa5c23933ace/1758194285/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758556413","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4045230/916498054/50c7dce599dbd86b632c3b90853eaa5c23933ace/1758194285/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758556413","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4045230/916498054/50c7dce599dbd86b632c3b90853eaa5c23933ace/1758194285/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758556413","id":257201117,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.